sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User as User / Technician
    participant Client as OpenDesk Client (Desktop/Mobile)
    participant API as OpenDesk Web API (ASP.NET Core 10)
    participant DB as PostgreSQL 17 Database
    participant Redis as Redis 7.4 Presence Cache

    User->>Client: Submit Credentials (Email, Password, TOTP MFA)
    Client->>API: POST /api/v1/auth/login
    API->>DB: Query User Record & Verify Argon2id Password Hash
    
    alt MFA Enabled
        API->>API: Validate 6-digit TOTP Code (RFC 6238)
    end

    API->>DB: Insert Rotating Refresh Token (SHA-256 Hashed)
    API->>Redis: Cache User Session & Active Permissions
    API-->>Client: 200 OK { AccessToken (JWT, 15m), RefreshToken (UUID), UserProfile }

    Note over Client: Securely store RefreshToken in OS Secure Keychain<br/>(Windows Credential Locker / macOS Keychain / Linux Secret Service)

    loop Token Refresh Every 14 Minutes
        Client->>API: POST /api/v1/auth/refresh { RefreshToken }
        API->>DB: Verify & Rotate Refresh Token
        API-->>Client: 200 OK { New AccessToken, New RefreshToken }
    end
